# Line endings are part of the sources JAR, and the sources JAR is one of the
# artifacts this project claims is byte-reproducible. Without a fixed policy the
# same commit produces a different sources JAR from a CRLF checkout than from an
# LF one, so everything textual is normalised to LF in the working tree as well
# as in the repository.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Anything that must never be touched.
*.se1     binary
*.jar     binary
*.png     binary
*.dll     binary
*.so      binary
*.dylib   binary
